Project Outcome
The project provided practical experience in risk-based manual testing of fintech applications, validating transaction workflows, ensuring duplicate prevention, testing resilience under network drops, and documenting defects with severity/priority logs.
It strengthened skills in functional, boundary, negative, and usability testing while working with UPI sandbox environments.
